Prompt:

Build a full-stack web application similar to SuperBill by DATEV KOINOS SRL, a professional billing and invoicing system for businesses and freelancers.

The platform should include:

1. Core Functionalities
User Authentication & Roles:

Register/login via email & password, Google & Microsoft sign-in

Roles: Admin, Accountant, Business Owner, Staff

Dashboard:

Overview of invoices, payments, expenses, deadlines

Charts for monthly revenue, expenses, outstanding payments

Invoices Management:

Create, edit, delete invoices (with template customization)

Upload & attach documents

Electronic invoice generation in PDF + XML formats

Email invoices to clients

Quotes & Orders:

Create quotes, convert to invoices

Create purchase orders and sales orders

Payment Tracking:

Record payments (bank, cash, online)

Mark partial or full payments

Automatic overdue reminders via email/SMS

Deadlines & Reminders:

Due dates for invoices & payments

Recurring billing (subscriptions)

Calendar view of deadlines

Reports:

Monthly/Yearly sales report

Taxes summary (GST/VAT)

Downloadable in Excel/PDF

Client & Supplier Management:

Add, edit, delete clients/suppliers

Contact details, payment preferences, notes

Healthcare System Integration (optional):

API integration for health cost submission (like Italy’s Health Card System)

Multi-Currency & Multi-Language Support

2. Technical Stack
Frontend: React.js + TailwindCSS (modern, responsive UI)

Backend: Node.js (Express.js)

Database: MongoDB or PostgreSQL

Authentication: JWT for API security + OAuth for Google/Microsoft login

Invoice PDF Generation: jsPDF or PDFKit

Email Sending: Nodemailer + SMTP

File Storage: AWS S3 or Cloudinary

Charts: Chart.js or Recharts for analytics

3. Extra Features
Dark & Light mode

Accountant shared access (read-only or edit access)

Export all data (CSV, Excel, PDF)

Mobile responsive design (works on 375px width)

RESTful API for mobile app integration

Admin Panel to manage users and billing settings

4. Deployment
Deploy backend on Render or AWS EC2

Deploy frontend on Vercel or Netlify

Use a custom domain with SSL (HTTPS)

5. Design Guidelines
Modern and minimal design

Easy navigation with sidebar menu

Use primary color palette similar to SuperBill: Blue (#1E88E5), White, Light Grey

Consistent typography with good readability

Deliver full source code with proper file structure, documentation, and installation guide.
